"><span class="rrssb-icon"></span><span class="rrssb-text">google+</span></a></li><li class="rrssb-email"><a href="mailto:?subject=Executive%20Order%2013764%E2%80%94Amending%20the%20Civil%20Service%20Rules%2C%20Executive%20Order%2013488%2C%20and%20Executive%20Order%2013467%20To%20Modernize%20the%20Executive%20Branch-Wide%20Governance%20Structure%20and%20Processes%20for%20Security%20Clearances%2C%20Suitability%20and%20Fitness%20for%20Employment%2C%20and%20Credentialing%2C%20and%20Related%20Matters&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.presidency.ucsb.edu%2Fdocuments%2Fexecutive-order-13764-amending-the-civil-service-rules-executive-order-13488-and-executive" ><span class="rrssb-icon"></span><span class="rrssb-text">email</span></a></li></ul></div>
